OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be largely dry but
OL,8,Fthickening cloud may bring a shower
OL,9,Facross Orkney later. Fresh northerly
OL,10,Fwinds easing down across Shetland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FShetland will be dry with
OL,13,Fbright spells. Orkney with be rather
OL,14,Fcloudy and dry for most of the day,
OL,15,Fchance of a few showers from late
OL,16,Fafternoon onwards.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,19,Fwith bright spells across Shetland on
OL,20,FMonday, cloudy with a chance of
OL,21,Fshowers across Orkney.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
